 "text": "Log in\nSubscribe\nHome\nPosts\nHow to Start and Scale an AI Agency\nHow to Start and Scale an AI Agency\n\nA free training on what to sell, how to find clients, and how to close them.\n\nSep 18, 2026\n\n•\n\n1 min read\n\nI ran a live training this week called How to Start and Scale an AI Agency, and it's now open to watch for free.\n\nWatch the training →\n\nIt answers the three questions people ask me most:\n\nWhat do I sell? The four AI services businesses are paying for right now, and what each one charges.\n\nWhere do I find clients? The three ways I've used, with the real numbers behind each one.\n\nHow do I close them? The order to run a sales call in, and the mistakes that lose the deal.\n\nI also go through picking a niche, which niches to avoid, and how to turn one client into repeat business so you're not starting from zero every month.\n\nThis is for you if you want to build something of your own with AI and you're not sure what to actually sell. You don't need to be technical, and you don't need a portfolio. Most of the people I've watched land their first client had neither.\n\nIf you'd rather talk it through than watch it, book a call with my team and we'll tell you honestly whether this is a fit for you.\n\nWatch the training →\n\nNick\n\nP.S. It's about 90 minutes and there's nothing to buy inside it. Here's the link again.\n\nQuick one so I send you the right stuff — which of these is you?\n\nWhich one sounds most like you?\nI run a business and I want to use AI to scale it.\nI'm building (or want to build) an AI business.\nI want to use AI to grow in my career and become irreplaceable at work.\nSomething else entirely\n\nLogin or Subscribe to participate\n\nKeep Reading\n\nAug 12, 2026\n\n•\n\n3 min read\n\nGive AI one task for five days\n\nThe simplest way to start using AI in your business — no tools, no automation.\n\nJul 29, 2026\n\n•\n\n4 min read\n\nAI hasn't paid off in your business yet. Your industry isn't the reason.\n\n$340K at one firm. $210K at another. Two builds with nothing in common.\n\nSep 18, 2026\n\n•\n\n1 min read\n\nHow to Get Paid for deploying AI \n\nA free training on what to sell, where the clients are, and what to charge.\n\nView more\nThe AI Core\n\nThis free newsletter is how you win the AI era.\n\nSubscribe\n© 2026 The AI Core.\nPowered by beehiiv\nLog in\nSubscribe",
